### Cerberus — coleção de requisições (IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client)
### Serviço rodando em http://localhost:8080

### Análise de força — senha fraca
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/password/strength
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "password" }

### Análise de força — senha forte
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/password/strength
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "9xQ!vTm2#Lp8zR" }

### Verificação de vazamento (k-anonymity)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/password/breach
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "password" }

### Auditoria completa contra a política
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/password/policy
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "Zx9q!Lm3#Tp7wRk2vBn8" }

### Gerar hash BCrypt
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/hash/bcrypt
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "MinhaSenh@1" }

### Verificar senha vs. hash (substitua o hash pelo gerado acima)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/hash/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "MinhaSenh@1", "hash": "$2a$12$COLOQUE_O_HASH_AQUI" }

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
